=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;region&quot;</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;Region:&quot;</span>, \r\n                    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">choices</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">colnames</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">WorldPhones</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,\r\n        <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">hr</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,\r\n        <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">helpText</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;Data from AT&amp;T (1961) The World&#39;s Telephones.&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>\r\n      <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,\r\n      \r\n      <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(76,136,107)\"># Create a spot for the barplot</span>\r\n      <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mainPanel</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span>\r\n        <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">plotlyOutput</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;phonePlot&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>  \r\n      <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>\r\n      \r\n    <span sty