b(0,0,0)\">region</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">]</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">*</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,205)\">1000</span>, \r\n            <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">main</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">region</span>,\r\n            <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ylab</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;Number of Telephones&quot;</span>,\r\n            <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">xlab</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;Year&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>\r\n</span>  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">}</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></code></pre><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:13px;padding:9.5px;line-height:1em;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-radius:4px;background-color:white\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:inherit;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">p &lt;- ggplotly(gg,session=&quot;knitr&quot;)\r\n  p\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135);box-sizing:border-box\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135);box-sizing:border-box\">)</span></code></pre></span></code></div></div